   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Pyramid Country** (1 other source): Pyramid Country runs straight into Secrets in the first set [2]\n- **Arabia** (1 other source): Notes mark Arabia as cut, so the version in the first set is incomplete [2]\n- **Hollow Heart** (1 other source): In the second set, Hollow Heart flows directly into Love or Confusion [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Doin' Thngs Right**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Arabia**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Roas Lee McFall**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Night Fishing**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Make Me A Pallet On Your Floor**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Broken Doe**: rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- **Love Or Confusion**: rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2026-08-01.BillyStringsBethel2026** (recommended): audience recording; 20 songs; 152 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **billystrings2026-08-01**: audience recording; 20 songs; 142 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2026-08-01.BillyStringsBethel2026**: taped by JT/NY; transferred by JT/NY; source: Aud > Nakamichi CM701's > GaKables > Lunatec V3 > Sound Devices 722 > CF @ 24/96 [1]. Also: Edited and tracked in Sound Forge Pro 18, converted to FLAC with Traders Little Helper, tagged in Foobar 2000 [1]\n- **billystrings2026-08-01**: taped by G-Man; transferred by G-Man; source: Aud> Audio Technica AT-2020> Tascam DR-40X [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by panetory.com: [Billy Strings Bethel Woods Center For The Arts Bethel NY Jul 31 Aug 1 2026 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/billy-strings-bethel-woods-center-for-the-arts-bethel-ny-jul-31-aug-1-2026-poster) [5]\n- Fan art by panetory.com: [Billy Strings Bethel Woods Center For The Arts Bethel NY Jul 31 Aug 1 2026 Poster 2026](https: